    "uplifting": {
      "title": "UpLifting",
      "description": "Your worst day does not get to write your ending.",
      "paragraphs": [
        "<p>UPLIFTING is music for the days when you need to remember that your story isn’t over.</p>",
        "<p>These songs don’t pretend life is easy or that pain disappears when you smile. They come from surviving the darkness and discovering that hope isn’t the absence of struggle—it’s choosing to rise while still carrying the scars.</p>",
        "<p>Whether you’re rebuilding your life, fighting a battle nobody sees, or simply searching for enough strength to take the next step, this playlist is here to remind you:</p>",
        "<p>You are still here.<br/>You are still becoming.<br/>You still have light left to give.</p>",
        "<p>Your worst day does not get to write your ending.</p>",
        "<p>The sunrise doesn’t ask for permission—and neither should you.</p>"
      ],
