      "html": "<article class=\"record-card\" data-track-count=\"1\" id=\"song-that-aint-holy\"><div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Official GhostHeart visualizer artwork for That Ain't Holy\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/videos/youtube/pJFJXPAiPto.jpg\" width=\"480\"/></div><div class=\"record-copy\"><div class=\"record-meta\"><span>Single / 1 track</span><span>Sep 6, 2026</span><span>September release</span></div><h3>That Ain't Holy</h3><p>A father-and-son story about poverty, dignity, and mercy.</p><div class=\"record-actions\"><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ptYn4vh6DCQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Watch the lyric video</a><a class=\"button\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nVWDTJfJht8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Listen to the release</a></div></div></article>",
