      "html": "<article class=\"record-card\" data-track-count=\"1\" id=\"hey-preacher-man\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Official Spotify cover artwork for Hey Preacher Man\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://i.scdn.co/image/ab67616d0000b273029070343a922d937f32bf01\" width=\"300\"/></div>\n<div class=\"record-copy\">\n<div class=\"record-meta\"><span>Release 10</span><span>Single • 1 track</span><span>You’re Not God</span></div>\n<h3>Hey Preacher Man</h3>\n<p>A direct answer to the judgment that tried to define a life from the outside.</p>\n<div class=\"record-actions\"><a aria-label=\"Watch Hey Preacher Man on YouTube (opens in a new tab)\" class=\"button\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2SEng4dmgUc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Watch</a><a aria-label=\"Listen to Hey Preacher Man on Spotify (opens in a new tab)\" class=\"button\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/album/47jSQrPpUbmIPEeEpzSVoh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Listen</a></div>\n</div>\n</article>",
