      "title": "This Is GhostHeart",
      "html": "<article class=\"record-card\" data-track-count=\"3\" id=\"this-is-ghostheart\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Official Spotify cover artwork for This Is GhostHeart\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.scdn.co/image/ab67616d0000b27337fc55f33c8f9fca6aca07cb\" width=\"300\"/></div>\n<div class=\"record-copy\">\n<div class=\"record-meta\"><span>Release 11</span><span>Multi-track • 3 tracks</span><span class=\"artist-pick\">Identity / Angel / Oath</span></div>\n<h3>This Is GhostHeart</h3>\n<p class=\"track-list\">Tracks: This Is GhostHeart • <span id=\"song-the-angel-who-made-ghostheart\">The Angel Who Made GhostHeart</span> • <span id=\"song-ghosthearts-oath\">GhostHeart's Oath</span></p>\n<p>Three doors into the heart, the Angel, and the oath behind the name.</p>\n<div class=\"record-actions\"><a aria-label=\"Listen to This Is GhostHeart on Spotify (opens in a new tab)\" class=\"button\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/album/7A6HiVbkTYi4Ug1TrMuseU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Listen</a></div>\n<details class=\"gh-track-list\"><summary>Listen to all 3 tracks on YouTube</summary><ol><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GuJgU0QxQLI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">This Is GhostHeart <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sSthfVLW3gE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The Angel Who Made GhostHeart <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mU8hixRrgKM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GhostHeart's Oath <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li></ol></details>\n</div>\n</article>",
