    {
      "id": "song-rebellion",
      "title": "Rebellion",
      "html": "<article class=\"record-card\" data-track-count=\"2\" id=\"song-rebellion\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover artwork for Rebellion\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/songs/rebellion.jpg\" width=\"900\"/></div>\n<div class=\"record-copy\">\n<div class=\"record-meta\"><span>Release 03</span><span>Multi-track • 2 tracks</span></div>\n<h3>Rebellion</h3>\n<p class=\"track-list\">Tracks: Rebellion • <span id=\"song-you-cant-change-us\">You Can't Change Us</span></p>\n<p>The moment survival refuses to stay silent.</p>\n<div class=\"record-actions\"><a aria-label=\"Listen to Rebellion on Spotify (opens in a new tab)\" class=\"button\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/album/7jkKCwKlYjadMvBsJokvDq\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Listen</a></div>\n<details class=\"gh-track-list\"><summary>Listen to all 2 tracks on YouTube</summary><ol><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i0a2Pltn9sM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Rebellion <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AJOGVvetmYY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">You Can't Change Us — original 3:55 version <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li></ol></details>\n</div>\n</article>",
