      "title": "What Did You Take From Her",
      "html": "<article class=\"record-card\" data-track-count=\"2\" id=\"song-what-did-you-take-from-her\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover artwork for What Did You Take From Her\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/songs/what-did-you-take-from-her.jpg\" width=\"900\"/></div>\n<div class=\"record-copy\">\n<div class=\"record-meta\"><span>Release 04</span><span>Multi-track • 2 tracks</span></div>\n<h3>What Did You Take From Her</h3>\n<p class=\"track-list\">Tracks: What Did You Take From Her • <span id=\"song-new-part-of-me\">New Part of Me</span></p>\n<p>A reckoning with what pain changed and what it could not erase.</p>\n<div class=\"record-actions\"><a aria-label=\"Watch What Did You Take From Her film\" class=\"button\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SkILbypDhxQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Watch</a><a aria-label=\"Listen to What Did You Take From Her on Spotify (opens in a new tab)\" class=\"button\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/album/2OdIWfDuaCGITzk1gx8eJm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Listen</a></div>\n<details class=\"gh-track-list\"><summary>Listen to all 2 tracks on YouTube</summary><ol><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1NSKNlEpdKA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What Did You Take From Her <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a-j77XE3Pl0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">New Part of Me <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li></ol></details>\n</div>\n</article>",
