      "title": "Still",
      "html": "<article class=\"record-card\" data-track-count=\"3\" id=\"song-still\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover artwork for Still\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/songs/still.jpg\" width=\"900\"/></div>\n<div class=\"record-copy\">\n<div class=\"record-meta\"><span>Release 05</span><span>Multi-track • 3 tracks</span><span class=\"artist-pick\">Artist Pick</span></div>\n<h3>Still</h3>\n<p class=\"track-list\">Tracks: Still • <span id=\"song-why-didnt-you-call\">Why Didn't You Call</span> • <span id=\"song-i-still-would\">I Still Would</span></p>\n<p>The quiet weight of what remains when everything else changes.</p>\n<div class=\"record-actions\"><a aria-label=\"Listen to Still on Spotify (opens in a new tab)\" class=\"button\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/album/10vHv1z2uCkLKcDDg508cN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Listen</a></div>\n<details class=\"gh-track-list\"><summary>Listen to all 3 tracks on YouTube</summary><ol><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-gdLKBRDHXw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Still <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kMzxK2lRT9k\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Why Didn't You Call <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b5xr2FxlCRY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">I Still Would <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></li></ol></details>\n</div>\n</article>",
