    {
      "id": "human-too",
      "title": "Human Too",
      "html": "<article class=\"record-card\" data-track-count=\"1\" id=\"human-too\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" id=\"song-human-too\"></span>\n<div class=\"cover\"><img alt=\"Cover artwork for Human Too\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/assets/songs/human-too.jpg\" width=\"900\"/></div>\n<div class=\"record-copy\">\n<div class=\"record-meta\"><span>Release 07</span><span>Single • 1 track</span><span>Aug 21, 2026</span></div>\n<h3>Human Too</h3>\n<p>A song about addiction, judgment, pain, and remembering that a human being is more than a label or a mistake.</p>\n<div class=\"record-actions\"><a aria-label=\"Listen to Human Too on Spotify (opens in a new tab)\" class=\"button\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/album/5BiC5SRSxlB13PSAJlFk88\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Listen</a></div>\n</div>\n</article>",
